<title>JAPAN: Gantan Beauty -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Gantan Beauty -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.86		vs	   15.62</p>
<p> Operating	  571    million	  vs	  592    million</p>
<p> Current	    390    million	  vs	  413    million</p>
<p> Net		  126    million	  vs	   95    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.96 yen	  vs	   13.10 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 15.87 yen	  vs	     nil yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Gantan Beauty Industry Co Ltd is a manufacturer-marketer of metal roofing materials.</p>
